// What Cammy does differently. She gets around like everybody else (movement_moves.hor) and starts from the same attacks (fighting_moves.hor,
// which is also where all of this is explained). The moves in here replace the ones of the same name in there and add her own, see characters.hor.
//
// Her animations have fewer frames than The Man's and play at half the rate, so every frame number in here is hers alone.
// Where he has one kick and one punch on two buttons each, she has a light and a heavy one of both, and they turn into other moves when she is crouching or in the air.
//
//                 standing        crouching             in the air
//   A             kick            crouch_kick           jump_light_kick
//   B             heavy kick      sweep                 jump_kick
//   X             light punch     crouch_punch          jump_light_punch
//   Y             heavy punch     crouch_heavy_punch    jump_punch
//   A + B         cannon_drill, she throws herself at the other player feet first. Costs a quarter of the meter
//   X + Y         cannon_spike, a kick straight up that launches whoever it meets. Costs a quarter of the meter too
//
//   Her sweep and crouch kick are lows (block them crouching), everything out of the air is an overhead (block it standing),
//   and the sweep, the drill and the spike all knock down.
//   LeftBumper    spinning_knuckle, a spin on the spot into a backfist that carries her forwards

